        "title": "Apache SkyWalking BanyanDB: Canopy does not enforce readonly-role restrictions on the /monitoring/* proxy",
        "problemTypes": [
          {
            "descriptions": [
              {
                "description": "CWE-863 Improper Authorization",
                "lang": "en",
                "cweId": "CWE-863",
                "type": "CWE"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "source": {
          "discovery": "EXTERNAL"
        },
        "affected": [
          {
            "vendor": "Apache Software Foundation",
            "product": "Apache SkyWalking BanyanDB",
            "packageURL": "pkg:golang/github.com/apache/skywalking-banyandb",
            "versions": [
              {
                "status": "affected",
                "version": "0.11.0",
                "lessThan": "0.11.1",
                "versionType": "semver"
              }
            ],
            "defaultStatus": "unaffected",
            "collectionURL": "https://golang.org/pkg",
            "packageName": "github.com/apache/skywalking-banyandb"
          }
        ],
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "value": "Improper Authorization vulnerability in Apache SkyWalking BanyanDB.\n\n\n\nThe Canopy includes incomplete proof-of-concept role and monitoring-proxy functionality. Under a non-default configuration with a readonly Canopy user and a reachable monitoring target, that user can send non-read requests through the monitoring proxy.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache SkyWalking BanyanDB: from 0.11.0 before 0.11.1.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 0.11.1, which fixes the issue.",
            "lang": "en",
            "supportingMedia": [
              {
                "type": "text/html",
                "base64": false,
                "value": "<p>Improper Authorization vulnerability in Apache SkyWalking BanyanDB.</p><p>The Canopy includes incomplete proof-of-concept role and monitoring-proxy functionality.&nbsp;<span>Under a </span><span>non-default configuration with a readonly Canopy user and a reachable&nbsp;</span><span>monitoring target, that user can send non-read requests through the&nbsp;</span><span>monitoring proxy.</span></p><p>This issue affects Apache SkyWalking BanyanDB: from 0.11.0 before 0.11.1.</p><p>Users are recommended to upgrade to version 0.11.1, which fixes the issue.</p>"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "references": [
          {
            "url": "https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/qz1ogm6b37gfqq04y0lkdj8x1zr5cb4r",
