        "title": "Frappe before 16.33.0 Broken Authorization via send_sms Endpoint",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "Frappe Framework before 15.120.0 and 16.x before 16.33.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the whitelisted send_sms API endpoint, which does not verify that the caller is permitted to send SMS messages. Users lacking the required permissions can invoke send_sms to send arbitrary SMS messages that impersonate the Company."
          }
        ],
        "problemTypes": [
