        "title": "Frappe before 15.4.0 XSS via Printview Parameters",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "Frappe before 14.58.0 and 15.x before 15.4.0 contains a cross-site scripting vulnerability in printview because printview parameters are not escaped before being rendered. Remote attackers can craft a malicious printview URL that, when visited by a victim, injects HTML and executes script in the victim's browser session."
          }
        ],
        "problemTypes": [
          {
